  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "asof": "2026-11-13 07:12 UTC",
  "headline": "Jensen Huang resigns as Nvidia's CEO \u2014 and the ten-year yield goes back above 5%",
  "standfirst": "Nvidia said Jensen Huang had resigned as chief executive, with CFO Colette Kress as interim CEO; the shares fell as much as 14% and closed 4.34% lower. As bonds reopened, the two-year rose about 15bp to 4.88% and the ten-year to 5.10%. The S&P slipped 0.35%, but the Russell fell 1.66% and gold 2.79%, while WTI rose 2.55% on attacks on Saudi oil sites. The book is flat; Q4 is +34.64 realised, heat 0R.",
  "themes": [
   {
    "kicker": "What's next",
    "right": "Friday: PPI and five Fed speakers",
