      "kind": "calendar"
     }
    ],
    "note": "<b>Friday brings October PPI</b> and five Fed speakers: Collins, Logan, Bowman, Daly and Jefferson. After Thursday's close <b>Cisco</b> rose about 0.5-3% after hours on revenue up 24% and a raised outlook, <b>Applied Materials</b> traded choppily after record revenue of $10.41bn, and <b>Cerebras</b> rose about 18%. <b>Nvidia</b> reports on 17 November."
